---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
    title="永續認養 - 禾騰技術"
    description="禾騰技術協助政府部門推動永續認養企業媒合服務，促進公私協力，共創環境、社會與經濟的三贏局面。"
>
    <!-- Page Banner -->
    <section class="page-banner">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
            <span class="section-label section-label-light"
                >Sustainability Adoption</span
            >
            <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold">永續認養</h1>
            <p class="text-lg text-white/85 max-w-2xl mt-4">
                禾騰技術協助政府部門媒合企業資源，透過認養機制推動環境永續行動，打造企業、政府與社區三贏的合作模式。
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Service Description -->
    <section class="py-16 lg:py-24 bg-white">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
                <div>
                    <span class="section-label">媒合服務</span>
                    <h2 class="section-title">企業永續認養媒合</h2>
                    <p class="text-text-body text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
                        永續認養是一項創新的公私協力機制，由政府提出需要長期維護與保育的公共設施或自然資源，禾騰技術作為專業顧問，媒合具有
                        ESG 目標的企業投入認養行動。
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-text-body leading-relaxed mb-6">
                        我們運用跨領域的工程技術與環境管理專業，為企業量身規劃認養方案，確保認養行動產生實質的環境效益，同時協助企業達成永續發展目標，實現企業社會責任。
                    </p>
                    <div class="space-y-4">
                        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                            <div
                                class="icon-box icon-box-green flex-shrink-0"
                                style="width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:8px;"
                            >
                                <svg
                                    class="w-5 h-5"
                                    fill="none"
                                    stroke="currentColor"
                                    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                                    ><path
                                        stroke-linecap="round"
                                        stroke-linejoin="round"
                                        stroke-width="2"
                                        d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"
                                    ></path></svg
                                >
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h4 class="font-bold text-text-title">
                                    專業評估與媒合
                                </h4>
                                <p class="text-sm text-text-body">
                                    依據企業 ESG
                                    方向與認養標的特性，進行最佳化配對
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                            <div
                                class="icon-box icon-box-blue flex-shrink-0"
                                style="width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:8px;"
                            >
                                <svg
                                    class="w-5 h-5"
                                    fill="none"
                                    stroke="currentColor"
                                    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                                    ><path
                                        stroke-linecap="round"
                                        stroke-linejoin="round"
                                        stroke-width="2"
                                        d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z"
                                    ></path></svg
                                >
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h4 class="font-bold text-text-title">
                                    成效追蹤與報告
                                </h4>
                                <p class="text-sm text-text-body">
                                    定期產出認養成效報告，量化環境貢獻指標
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                            <div
                                class="icon-box icon-box-sky flex-shrink-0"
                                style="width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:8px;"
                            >
                                <svg
                                    class="w-5 h-5"
                                    fill="none"
                                    stroke="currentColor"
                                    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                                    ><path
                                        stroke-linecap="round"
                                        stroke-linejoin="round"
                                        stroke-width="2"
                                        d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z"
                                    ></path></svg
                                >
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h4 class="font-bold text-text-title">
                                    多方利害關係人協調
                                </h4>
                                <p class="text-sm text-text-body">
                                    整合政府、企業、在地社區需求，建立長期夥伴關係
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-bg-light rounded-2xl p-8">
                    <div class="text-center mb-8">
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text-title mb-2">
                            認養服務流程
                        </h3>
                        <p class="text-text-muted text-sm">
                            從需求評估到成效追蹤的完整服務
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="space-y-6">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                            <div
                                class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-brand-green text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm flex-shrink-0"
                            >
                                1
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h4 class="font-bold text-text-title text-sm">
                                    需求盤點
                                </h4>
                                <p class="text-xs text-text-muted">
                                    政府單位提出認養標的與需求
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                            <div
                                class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-brand-blue text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm flex-shrink-0"
                            >
                                2
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h4 class="font-bold text-text-title text-sm">
                                    專業評估
                                </h4>
                                <p class="text-xs text-text-muted">
                                    禾騰進行現場勘查與可行性評估
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                            <div
                                class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-accent-sky text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm flex-shrink-0"
                            >
                                3
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h4 class="font-bold text-text-title text-sm">
                                    企業媒合
                                </h4>
                                <p class="text-xs text-text-muted">
                                    依據企業 ESG 目標進行最佳化配對
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                            <div
                                class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-brand-green-light text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm flex-shrink-0"
                            >
                                4
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h4 class="font-bold text-text-title text-sm">
                                    執行與追蹤
                                </h4>
                                <p class="text-xs text-text-muted">
                                    協助執行認養方案並定期追蹤成效
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Adoption Types -->
    <section class="py-16 lg:py-24 bg-bg-light">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
            <div class="text-center mb-12">
                <span class="section-label">認養類型</span>
                <h2 class="section-title">多元認養方案</h2>
                <p class="text-text-body max-w-2xl mx-auto">
                    根據不同的環境議題與維護需求，我們提供多種認養類型，為企業創造多面向的永續價值
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
                <!-- 設施維護 Card (Static, not clickable) -->
                <div class="card bg-white relative overflow-hidden opacity-75">
                    <div class="absolute top-4 right-4">
                        <span class="tag text-xs">即將推出</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="icon-box icon-box-blue mb-6">
                        <svg
                            class="w-7 h-7"
                            fill="none"
                            stroke="currentColor"
                            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                        >
                            <path
                                stroke-linecap="round"
                                stroke-linejoin="round"
                                stroke-width="2"
                                d="M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4"
                            ></path>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-title mb-3">
                        設施維護
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-text-body leading-relaxed mb-4">
                        認養公共設施進行定期維護與改善，包括水利設施、步道系統、休憩設施等，維持公共資產的服務品質與安全性。
                    </p>
                    <span
                        class="inline-flex items-center text-text-muted font-medium text-sm"
                    >
                        敬請期待
                    </span>
                </div>

                <!-- 水源保育 Card (Clickable) -->
                <a
                    href="/sustainability/water"
                    class="card bg-white group cursor-pointer border-2 border-transparent hover:border-brand-green transition-all no-underline"
                >
                    <div class="absolute top-4 right-4">
                        <span class="tag tag-green text-xs">已上線</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="icon-box icon-box-green mb-6">
                        <svg
                            class="w-7 h-7"
                            fill="none"
                            stroke="currentColor"
                            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                        >
                            <path
                                stroke-linecap="round"
                                stroke-linejoin="round"
                                stroke-width="2"
                                d="M3 15a4 4 0 004 4h9a5 5 0 10-.1-9.999 5.002 5.002 0 10-9.78 2.096A4.001 4.001 0 003 15z"
                            ></path>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3
                        class="text-xl font-bold text-text-title mb-3 group-hover:text-brand-green transition-colors"
                    >
                        水源保育
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-text-body leading-relaxed mb-4">
                        集水區水源保育認養計畫，透過企業認養在地農場推動友善耕作，減少化肥與農藥使用，從源頭守護水質。
                    </p>
                    <span
                        class="inline-flex items-center text-brand-green font-medium text-sm group-hover:gap-2 transition-all"
                    >
                        進入計畫頁面
                        <svg
                            class="w-4 h-4 ml-1"
                            fill="none"
                            stroke="currentColor"
                            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                        >
                            <path
                                stroke-linecap="round"
                                stroke-linejoin="round"
                                stroke-width="2"
                                d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path>
                        </svg>
                    </span>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA Section -->
    <section
        class="py-16 lg:py-24 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-green to-brand-green-light"
    >
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
            <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-6">
                攜手推動永續行動
            </h2>
            <p class="text-lg text-white/85 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8">
                無論您是尋求 ESG
                實踐方案的企業，還是希望推動地方永續發展的政府單位，我們都期待與您合作。
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
                <a href="/contact" class="btn-white"> 聯絡我們 </a>
                <a
                    href="/services"
                    class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3.5 rounded-lg font-semibold text-white border-2 border-white/30 hover:bg-white/10 transition-all"
                >
                    了解專業服務
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>
